{"meta":{"id":"tt2458776","type":"movie","name":"Osos","imdb_id":"tt2458776","description":"Los cineastas Alastair Fothergill y Keith Scholey narran un año de la vida de un oso pardo de Alaska llamado Sky y sus cachorros, Scout y Amber. Su saga comienza cuando los osos salen de la hibernación al final del invierno. A medida que pasa el tiempo, la familia de los osos debe trabajar juntos para encontrar comida y mantenerse a salvo de otros depredadores, especialmente de otros osos. Aunque su mundo es emocionante, también es arriesgado, y la supervivencia de los cachorros depende de la unión familiar.","poster":"https://btttr.cc/poster-q/imdb/poster-default/tt2458776.jpg?tag=none&lang=es-MX&rs=IM","background":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/8dqdWKHbrFTQj0ttq6AdwWkUYeU.jpg","logo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/wvNVP26VAaZ3MoYZAnBXU3EThYf.png","genres":["Documental"],"releaseInfo":"2014","released":"2014-04-17T12:00:00.000Z","status":"Released","runtime":"78 min","imdbRating":"7.3","country":"United States of America","cast":["John C. Reilly"],"director":["Keith Scholey","Alastair Fothergill"],"trailers":[{"source":"a6gHj0bHmg8","type":"Trailer","name":"Disneynature's Bears - Official Trailer","ytId":"a6gHj0bHmg8","lang":"en"}],"trailerStreams":[{"ytId":"a6gHj0bHmg8","title":"Disneynature's Bears - Official Trailer"}],"links":[{"name":"7.3","category":"imdb","url":"https://imdb.com/title/tt2458776"},{"name":"Documental","category":"Genres","url":"stremio:///discover/https%3A%2F%2Fv3-cinemeta.strem.io%2Fmanifest.json/movie/top?genre=Documental"},{"name":"John C. Reilly","category":"Cast","url":"stremio:///search?search=John%20C.%20Reilly"},{"name":"Keith Scholey","category":"Directors","url":"stremio:///search?search=Keith%20Scholey"},{"name":"Alastair Fothergill","category":"Directors","url":"stremio:///search?search=Alastair%20Fothergill"}],"app_extras":{"cast":[{"name":"John C. Reilly","character":"Self - Narrator (voice)","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t